# Add to .github/CODEOWNERS (GitHub) so nobody can quietly weaken the security setup:
# any change to these files needs approval from the security / platform team.
/.security/                         @<ORG>/<security-team>
/.github/workflows/security-*.yml   @<ORG>/<security-team>
# .security/ above already covers .security/zap/: that folder lists what ZAP is allowed to attack, so its reviews matter most.
